  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Big_Lost_City/MP_BigLostCity_header.webp\" width=\"2133\" height=\"686\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">【Big Lost City】是一款全新的建築模組，部分靈感來自【The Lost City】，但在此模組中，建築物預設會在世界中生成。當然，所有建築都是從零開始打造的，且這個模組與任何其他建築模組完全相容。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Big_Lost_City/MP_BigLostCity_description.webp\" width=\"2133\" height=\"175\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">我們開發這個模組的目的是讓它能融入任何末日風格模組包中，如您將在下方影片中所見，它添加了各式各樣的現代建築，但這些建築因時間流逝而完全廢棄。<br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">部分建築的靈感來自於 tsunami 所製作的一張地圖。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-Xh736Ry5oQ?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Big_Lost_City/MP_BigLostCity_screenshots.webp\" width=\"2133\" height=\"175\"></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1556/90/big-lost-city-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2133\" height=\"1200\"></p><p>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1556/103/big-lost-city-3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2133\" height=\"1200\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1556/114/big-lost-city-6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2133\" height=\"1200\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>準備好與好友在最佳伺服器上遊玩了嗎？</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fflashh\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Big_Lost_City/MP_BigLostCity_promo.webp\" width=\"2133\" height=\"267\"></strong></a></span><